# Platform: mobilesite
# Imported from Testsigma: RFQ flow Change - Login after 1st question & max 2 question to be shown (test case 2026, run 115613, last result FAILURE)
# Tags: regression
# OFF steps: every step that would send a REAL lead / enquiry / OTP is switched off,
#   plus the checks that only pass after it. Switch them on only when a lead is wanted.

call Live_Touch_Chrome_Navigate_to_Homepage_setup_Popup
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/Skf-Ball-Bearing-Deep-Groove-Single-Row-6205-2Z-1-Nos/pid-272203217/022PXX22-XX22-140307153118-I6K6?idx=0&jdmid=jdm-1008206-ent-4-7192762&alsoserveCity=Mumbai&nid=10034271
wait 2 seconds
store text of ps_pdp_top_product_name as pdp_productname
click pdp_gallery_inner_get_best_price_button
wait 2 seconds
store text of rfq_product_name as rfq_productname
verify stored rfq_productname contains "${pdp_productname}"
type "2" into rfq_quantity_input
js click rfq_next_button
# OFF: click rfq_next_button
# OFF: call SG_Touch_B2B_RFQ_Login_Form
# OFF: click rfq_don_t_know_button
# OFF: click rfq_skip_all_button
# OFF: wait until element rfq_continue_with_search_button is visible
# OFF: click rfq_continue_with_search_button
delete all cookies
wait 2 seconds
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/
wait 2 seconds
call PS_consent_popup
open https://www.justdial.com/jdmart/Mumbai/CCTV/jdm-1016209-ent-2-13630321?fl=undefined&ismap=undefined&subpage=&searchCase=&term=cctv&searchLocUpdate=0&stype=category_list&srcterm=CCTV
wait 2 seconds
store text of ps_b2b_prp_1st_product as prp_1stProduct
wait until element prp_best_price is visible
click prp_best_price
# Live 02-Oct-2026: PRP Get Best Price opens the B2B Assist AI chat (login first), not the old RFQ form
wait until element b2b_assist_chat_login_link is visible
verify element b2b_assist_first_card contains "${prp_1stProduct}"
verify text "Log in to begin" on page
